# Upstream game-data snapshots. Fetched by backend/tools/fetch-upstream.sh,
# never committed: the sources carry no licence, and absence of a licence is
# all rights reserved rather than permission. See Q3 in TRACKER.md and ADR 0009.
#
# Named specifically rather than as **/upstream/, which was the first attempt
# and silently stopped tracking the adapter's own test fixtures under
# src/test/resources/upstream/. A broad ignore rule fails by omission and the
# omission does not show up until CI cannot compile.
upstream-snapshots/
